#: camlibs/kodak/dc3200/dc3200.c:435
msgid ""
"Known problems:\n"
"\n"
"1. If the Kodak DC3200 does not receive a command at least every 10 seconds, "
"it will time out, and will have to be re-initialized. If you notice the "
"camera does not respond, simply re-select the camera. This will cause it to "
"reinitialize."
msgstr ""
"Poznati problemi:\n"
"\n"
"1. Ukoliko Kodak DC3200 nije primio komandu bar svakih 10 sekudni, vrijeme "
"je isteklo, i morat ce biti restartovan. Ukoliko primjećujete da kamera ne "
"reaguje, jednostavno uradit re-select kamere. Ovo ce prouzrokovati restart."

